#: ../../../developer/services/qrexec2.rst:101 eecaf4a7082e4ac29f1278a1512ffe25
msgid ""
"By default, stderr of client and server is logged to respective ``/var/log/"
"qubes/qrexec.XID`` files, in each of the VM."
