#: ../../../developer/services/qrexec2.rst:103 71b65fb33d8c446ca646cace6ef80c81
msgid ""
"Be very careful when coding and adding a new RPC service! Any vulnerability "
"in a RPC server can be fatal to security of the target VM!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/qrexec2.rst:105 b0d487db12434e39b561b59ffa566174
